# Safe bootstrap mode: remote changes flow toward the local Maildir only.
# Do not change this until every account has passed the tutorial's tests.
Sync Pull
Create Near
Remove None
Expunge None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

IMAPAccount nerdio-infra
Host mail.nerdio.app
Port 993
Timeout 30
User infra@nerdio.app
PassCmd "~/.local/bin/neomutt-credentials --password-only --username infra@nerdio.app --hostname mail.nerdio.app --type imaps"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore nerdio-infra-remote
Account nerdio-infra

MaildirStore nerdio-infra-local
Path ~/.local/share/mail/nerdio-infra/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/nerdio-infra/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel nerdio-infra
Sync New Gone Flags
Expunge Both
Far :nerdio-infra-remote:
Near :nerdio-infra-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "Sent" "Drafts" "Trash"
MaxMessages 100
ExpireSide Near
ExpireUnread no

